---
// AboutSection component
---

<section class="py-24 relative overflow-hidden bg-surface/30">
  <div class="container mx-auto px-6 max-w-4xl">
    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center">
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-6 tracking-tight">About the Event</h2>
        <div class="space-y-4 text-text-muted leading-relaxed">
          <p>
            Qiskit Fall Fest is a collection of quantum computing events on college campuses around the world.
          </p>
          <p>
            At Bharathidasan University, we are uniting students, researchers, and developers to learn the fundamentals of quantum computation and experiment directly with IBM Quantum hardware via the cloud.
          </p>
          <p>
            Whether you are a physics major or a computer science student, the quantum future needs builders from every discipline.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="bg-surface border border-border p-8 rounded-2xl">
        <div class="text-4xl font-bold text-primary mb-2">2</div>
        <p class="text-text-muted mb-6">Days of deep learning and challenges</p>
        
        <div class="text-4xl font-bold text-quantum mb-2">100+</div>
        <p class="text-text-muted">Expected participants</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
